{"title":"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/6/8763b276b45bcaa9d42bb9c7638fdd70404e7f55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;y&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/e/4de8e71c5517cf931470ee4a9de1af391215eaf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+xy=80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"126\" height=\"16\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/e/54e59c3ca4fc7ec3f402de90142f41b9cfdc58ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 10 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 15 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 18 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"385\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Use <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=SFFT\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SFFT\">SFFT</a> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/8/93878f38ef9f5fcbe926cd28ed0ca73f5cde9412.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+1)(y+1)=81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"152\" height=\"18\" />. The terms <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/e/00ed6a7b53eca338b27229604a5e8706ca609ccb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/f/92f974289e02b578ca91484886e41551ed32163c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" /> must be factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87edbdda753b32453027dc7cab023c0743b6b243.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />, which include <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/5/5d55029dcf0b5a9d762573ee0f8d0b096942684b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 3, 9, 27, 81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"95\" height=\"16\" />. Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/7/ab7da572d60053bdb3ab92f2dda44f87cd9dc78d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/cccb103143393c0119f5ab61d6d53a852ce70fcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/1051e7d41ec0b8bd688a872be17538413f4ee97b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87edbdda753b32453027dc7cab023c0743b6b243.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />. But if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/7/677170ac927390c7040695bf5690118f2526d143.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+1=81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/8/ec89f09c84538ec43930ca5d8e5e0957e2000822.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" /> and so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/8/398556637e7aa60fc829a2c8354e77b0c1baed8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 26}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plug in values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, noting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/7/ab7da572d60053bdb3ab92f2dda44f87cd9dc78d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" /> and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is an integer. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/4/62434ae80ca145c20f0fbc7563f5151371ed163c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/f/45f8321453bf3b13ff8ee2782e7149b1dfabf1cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 + y + 8y = 80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"126\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/f/4ff8bbad79fc034a1b35329acef5492dc937ecd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> (Does not work because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/7/ab7da572d60053bdb3ab92f2dda44f87cd9dc78d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" />)\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce07f44aade9496a90bf9ffa973f2152fcee4d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/0/8b09df6987c45a8089b0362e62b1b478118ab9e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 + y + 10y = 80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/f/51fad4699804a7ada24a260932e41823caa5954b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 70/11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"20\" /> (Does not work because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is not an integer)\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/a/89a4662a1dcd96b0a6bc7d5abfe65f22109532a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/f/befcef35f9e85760655a66ca8c4f6d41c32e36d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 + y + 15y = 80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/f/f8fb3ebb31be1be27d6325ddc3d63aab04c1b17c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 65/16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"20\" /> (Does not work because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is not an integer)\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/d/e3d3e4315e912987aa3b30ed98d1a76b68101997.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/d/7fd9c7ed74962ea7c9924a650688575a168eb5c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18 + y + 18y = 80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/9/ee9dbed18e50e918d312fd6ba82eca7a873526a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 62/19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"20\" /> (Does not work because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is not an integer)\n</p><p><br />\nThus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/d/c9db00326b618c1b3c7a165f704cec548646806a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 26$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/f/8ffe7b389669d4b913e179995e5e340d7acca75e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 26}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"62\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n~ Solution by CYB3RFLARE7408\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ba6w1OhXqOQ?t=4512\">https://youtu.be/ba6w1OhXqOQ?t=4512</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A\">2015 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017235758\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 295/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1961/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 156/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7171/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.790      1 Template:AMC12_box\n100.00%    7.790      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13959:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017235758 and revision id 261715. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}